  "contract_corrections": [
    "Private API token for same business and active subscription; public Business ID and token name are not credentials.",
    "Backend profile mapping and actual initialized browser session; same-profile attached session for combined synchronous tracking request, dedicated attachment flow first. Official generic unattached-session statement is not copied over the reviewed controller/Base behavior.",
    "Use one object/object_parameters choice, stable source/reference+ID mapping; object mutation can precede acceptance and inline lookup does not guarantee catalog updates.",
    "Original event time in explicit-zone ISO or Unix seconds; omitted default is processing time, not guaranteed request receipt time.",
    "Major-unit amount with original currency; resource value can be inherited, not necessarily zero.",
    "Received after initial validation before asynchronous event processing;403subscription,401token,404action,422validation.",
    "Named action definition vs occurrence; existing fictional appointment.booked aligns catalog with example, no event saved.",
    "Identified kept order/action protection is not general request idempotency and does not cover anonymous insertion path.",
    "Ambiguous timeouts/server errors require outcome reconciliation before repeat; source ID belongs to integration queue and is not a Hellotext idempotency key."
  ],
